WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:02.240
Matthew 26

00:02.240 --> 00:07.620
When Jesus had finished all these sayings, he said to his disciples,

00:08.520 --> 00:11.780
You know that after two days the Passover is coming,

00:12.160 --> 00:15.680
and the Son of Man will be delivered up to be crucified.

00:16.780 --> 00:21.360
Then the chief priests and the elders of the people gathered in the palace of the high priest,

00:21.520 --> 00:27.740
whose name was Caiaphas, and plotted together in order to arrest Jesus by stealth and kill him.

00:27.740 --> 00:34.180
But they said, Not during the feast, lest there be an uproar among the people.

00:35.820 --> 00:39.700
Now when Jesus was at Bethany in the house of Simon the leper,

00:40.080 --> 00:44.780
a woman came up to him with an alabaster flask of very expensive ointment,

00:45.200 --> 00:48.060
and she poured it on his head as he reclined at table.

00:48.720 --> 00:51.260
And when the disciples saw it, they were indignant, saying,

00:51.700 --> 00:57.540
Why this waste? For this could have been sold for a large sum, and given to the poor.

00:58.420 --> 01:01.560
But Jesus, aware of this, said to them,

01:02.180 --> 01:06.840
Why do you trouble the woman? For she has done a beautiful thing to me.

01:07.560 --> 01:11.740
For you always have the poor with you, but you will not always have me.

01:12.660 --> 01:17.020
In pouring this ointment on my body, she has done it to prepare me for burial.

01:17.940 --> 01:22.560
Truly I say to you, wherever this gospel is proclaimed in the whole world,

01:22.980 --> 01:26.820
what she has done will also be told in memory of her.

01:27.740 --> 01:32.760
Then one of the twelve, whose name was Judas Iscariot, went to the chief priests, and said,

01:33.460 --> 01:36.120
What will you give me if I deliver him over to you?

01:36.700 --> 01:39.000
And they paid him thirty pieces of silver.

01:39.560 --> 01:43.220
And from that moment he sought an opportunity to betray him.

01:43.920 --> 01:48.820
Now on the first day of unleavened bread the disciples came to Jesus, saying,

01:49.560 --> 01:52.220
Where will you have us prepare for you to eat the Passover?

01:53.040 --> 01:56.860
He said, Go into the city to a certain man and say to him,

01:56.860 --> 01:59.840
The teacher says, My time is at hand.

02:00.160 --> 02:03.060
I will keep the Passover at your house with my disciples.

02:03.620 --> 02:08.060
And the disciples did as Jesus had directed them, and they prepared the Passover.

02:08.820 --> 02:12.400
When it was evening, he reclined at table with the twelve.

02:13.100 --> 02:14.920
And as they were eating, he said,

02:15.680 --> 02:19.840
Truly I say to you, one of you will betray me.

02:20.240 --> 02:24.400
And they were very sorrowful and began to say to him one after another,

02:24.880 --> 02:26.740
Is it I, Lord?

02:27.480 --> 02:28.240
He answered,

02:29.140 --> 02:32.620
He who has dipped his hand in the dish with me will betray me.

02:33.240 --> 02:35.920
The Son of Man goes as it is written of him.

02:36.440 --> 02:39.580
But woe to that man by whom the Son of Man is betrayed.

02:40.340 --> 02:44.020
It would have been better for that man if he had not been born.

02:45.080 --> 02:47.940
Judas, who would betray him, answered,

02:48.660 --> 02:49.820
Is it I, Rabbi?

02:50.300 --> 02:51.780
He said to him,

02:52.720 --> 02:54.040
You have said so.

02:54.860 --> 02:56.820
Now as they were eating, Jesus took bread,

02:57.480 --> 02:59.680
and after blessing it, broke it,

03:00.280 --> 03:02.220
and gave it to the disciples and said,

03:02.920 --> 03:06.100
Take, eat, this is my body.

03:06.460 --> 03:09.900
And he took a cup, and when he had given thanks,

03:10.440 --> 03:11.680
he gave it to them, saying,

03:12.560 --> 03:16.800
Drink of it, all of you, for this is my blood of the covenant,

03:17.280 --> 03:20.680
which is poured out for many for the forgiveness of sins.

03:21.680 --> 03:25.660
I tell you, I will not drink again of this fruit of the vine

03:25.660 --> 03:26.840
until that day when I am dead.

03:26.840 --> 03:29.560
And I drink it new with you in my Father's kingdom.

03:30.700 --> 03:32.900
And when they had sung a hymn,

03:33.340 --> 03:35.300
they went out to the Mount of Olives.

03:36.040 --> 03:37.580
Then Jesus said to them,

03:38.480 --> 03:41.360
You will all fall away because of me this night,

03:41.780 --> 03:42.620
for it is written,

03:43.280 --> 03:44.520
I will strike the shepherd,

03:44.700 --> 03:46.660
and the sheep of the flock will be scattered.

03:47.460 --> 03:49.140
But after I am raised up,

03:49.500 --> 03:51.540
I will go before you to Galilee.

03:52.300 --> 03:53.260
Peter answered him,

03:53.960 --> 03:56.100
Though they all fall away because of you,

03:56.100 --> 03:58.040
I will never fall away.

03:58.800 --> 04:00.080
Jesus said to him,

04:00.960 --> 04:02.280
Truly I tell you,

04:02.660 --> 04:05.420
this very night before the rooster crows,

04:06.040 --> 04:08.480
you will deny me three times.

04:09.300 --> 04:10.120
Peter said to him,

04:10.880 --> 04:12.900
Even if I must die with you,

04:13.400 --> 04:15.260
I will not deny you.

04:15.920 --> 04:17.760
And all the disciples said the same.

04:18.620 --> 04:21.920
Then Jesus went with them to a place called Gethsemane,

04:22.420 --> 04:23.940
and he said to his disciples,

04:24.540 --> 04:25.460
Sit here,

04:25.460 --> 04:27.320
while I go over there and pray.

04:28.140 --> 04:31.360
And taking with him Peter and the two sons of Zebedee,

04:31.440 --> 04:33.620
he began to be sorrowful and troubled.

04:34.040 --> 04:35.300
Then he said to them,

04:36.000 --> 04:38.020
My soul is very sorrowful,

04:38.440 --> 04:39.560
even to death.

04:40.380 --> 04:42.680
Remain here and watch with me.

04:43.360 --> 04:44.660
And going a little farther,

04:44.800 --> 04:47.460
he fell on his face and prayed, saying,

04:48.280 --> 04:48.980
My father,

04:49.320 --> 04:51.120
if it be possible,

04:51.700 --> 04:53.560
let this cup pass from me.

04:54.320 --> 04:54.960
Nevertheless,

04:55.460 --> 04:58.040
not as I will,

04:58.800 --> 04:59.800
but as you will.

05:00.520 --> 05:03.720
And he came to the disciples and found them sleeping.

05:04.540 --> 05:06.060
And he said to Peter,

05:06.840 --> 05:09.640
So could you not watch with me one hour?

05:10.560 --> 05:14.140
Watch and pray that you may not enter into temptation.

05:14.940 --> 05:16.880
The spirit indeed is willing,

05:17.560 --> 05:19.000
but the flesh is weak.

05:19.860 --> 05:23.000
Again for the second time he went away and prayed,

05:24.140 --> 05:25.260
My father,

05:25.460 --> 05:28.560
if this cannot pass unless I drink it,

05:29.420 --> 05:30.700
your will be done.

05:31.640 --> 05:33.980
And again he came and found them sleeping,

05:34.160 --> 05:35.460
for their eyes were heavy.

05:36.220 --> 05:36.560
So,

05:37.260 --> 05:38.300
leaving them again,

05:38.860 --> 05:41.280
he went away and prayed for the third time,

05:41.420 --> 05:43.320
saying the same words again.

05:44.000 --> 05:46.640
Then he came to the disciples and said to them,

05:47.360 --> 05:47.840
Sleep,

05:48.320 --> 05:50.260
and take your rest later on.

05:51.060 --> 05:51.560
See,

05:52.020 --> 05:53.140
the hour is at hand,

05:53.140 --> 05:55.440
and the Son of Man is betrayed into the hands,

05:55.460 --> 05:56.280
into the hands of sinners.

05:56.940 --> 05:57.340
Rise,

05:57.480 --> 05:58.240
let us be going.

05:58.820 --> 05:59.080
See,

05:59.140 --> 06:00.560
my betrayer is at hand.

06:01.260 --> 06:02.700
While he was still speaking,

06:03.100 --> 06:03.760
Judas came,

06:04.160 --> 06:05.020
one of the twelve,

06:05.600 --> 06:08.920
and with him a great crowd with swords and clubs

06:08.920 --> 06:11.200
from the chief priests and the elders of the people.

06:11.780 --> 06:14.000
Now the betrayer had given them a sign,

06:14.200 --> 06:14.540
saying,

06:15.240 --> 06:16.620
The one who will kiss is the man.

06:16.760 --> 06:17.300
Seize him.

06:18.080 --> 06:20.360
And he came up to Jesus at once and said,

06:21.000 --> 06:21.640
Greetings,

06:22.060 --> 06:22.340
Rabbi.

06:23.280 --> 06:24.080
And he kissed him.

06:24.620 --> 06:25.440
Jesus said,

06:25.460 --> 06:25.880
And he said to him,

06:26.660 --> 06:27.120
Friend,

06:27.840 --> 06:29.780
do what you came to do.

06:30.560 --> 06:33.580
Then they came up and laid hands on Jesus and seized him.

06:33.940 --> 06:34.420
And behold,

06:34.620 --> 06:37.960
one of those who were with Jesus stretched out his hand and drew his sword

06:37.960 --> 06:40.940
and struck the servant of the high priest and cut off his ear.

06:41.500 --> 06:42.740
Then Jesus said to him,

06:43.520 --> 06:45.320
Put your sword back into its place,

06:46.000 --> 06:48.880
for all who take the sword will perish by the sword.

06:49.660 --> 06:51.940
Do you think that I cannot appeal to my father,

06:51.940 --> 06:55.180
and he will at once send me more than twelve legions of angels?

06:55.880 --> 06:59.880
But how then should the scriptures be fulfilled that it must be so?

07:00.540 --> 07:02.720
At that hour Jesus said to the crowds,

07:03.160 --> 07:05.520
Have you come out as against a robber,

07:05.940 --> 07:08.020
with swords and clubs to capture me?

07:08.680 --> 07:11.400
Day after day I sat in the temple teaching,

07:11.740 --> 07:13.160
and you did not seize me.

07:13.820 --> 07:18.500
But all this has taken place that the scriptures of the prophets might be fulfilled.

07:19.300 --> 07:22.260
Then all the disciples left him and fled.

07:22.840 --> 07:25.300
Then those who had seized Jesus led him to Caiaphas,

07:25.760 --> 07:26.460
the high priest,

07:26.560 --> 07:28.600
where the scribes and the elders had gathered.

07:29.540 --> 07:31.500
And Peter was following him at a distance,

07:31.660 --> 07:34.140
as far as the courtyard of the high priest,

07:34.140 --> 07:37.800
and going inside he sat with the guards to see the end.

07:38.560 --> 07:43.000
Now the chief priests and the whole council were seeking false testimony against Jesus

07:43.000 --> 07:44.380
that they might put him to death,

07:44.940 --> 07:46.080
but they found none,

07:46.540 --> 07:49.040
though many false witnesses came forward.

07:49.540 --> 07:51.700
At last two came forward and said,

07:52.440 --> 07:53.400
This man said,

07:53.760 --> 07:55.440
I am able to destroy the temple,

07:55.440 --> 07:58.200
and to rebuild it in three days.

07:58.780 --> 08:01.500
And the high priest stood up and said,

08:02.260 --> 08:04.200
Have you no answer to make?

08:04.540 --> 08:08.140
What is it that these men testify against you?

08:08.860 --> 08:10.880
But Jesus remained silent,

08:11.440 --> 08:12.900
and the high priest said to him,

08:13.640 --> 08:16.180
I adjure you by the living God,

08:16.560 --> 08:18.360
tell us if you are the Christ,

08:18.820 --> 08:20.360
the Son of God.

08:20.960 --> 08:22.740
Jesus said to him,

08:23.080 --> 08:24.620
You have said so,

08:24.620 --> 08:25.900
but I tell you,

08:26.320 --> 08:30.080
from now on you will see the Son of Man seated at the right hand of power,

08:30.400 --> 08:32.220
and coming on the clouds of heaven.

08:33.120 --> 08:36.240
Then the high priest tore his robes and said,

08:37.060 --> 08:38.660
He has uttered blasphemy.

08:39.020 --> 08:41.800
What further witnesses do we need?

08:42.500 --> 08:44.940
You have now heard his blasphemy.

08:45.320 --> 08:46.600
What is your judgment?

08:47.540 --> 08:48.420
They answered,

08:49.240 --> 08:50.860
He deserves death.

08:51.860 --> 08:54.540
Then they spit in his face and struck him,

08:54.620 --> 08:56.420
and some slapped him, saying,

08:56.800 --> 08:58.800
Prophesy to us, you Christ.

08:59.340 --> 09:00.520
Who is it that struck you?

09:01.200 --> 09:04.460
Now Peter was sitting outside in the courtyard,

09:05.020 --> 09:07.000
and a servant girl came up to him and said,

09:07.740 --> 09:10.400
You also were with Jesus the Galilean.

09:10.760 --> 09:12.580
But he denied it before them all, saying,

09:13.320 --> 09:15.140
I do not know what you mean.

09:15.800 --> 09:17.600
And when he went out to the entrance,

09:17.900 --> 09:19.360
another servant girl saw him,

09:19.660 --> 09:21.040
and she said to the bystanders,

09:21.500 --> 09:24.540
This man was with Jesus of Nazareth,

09:25.260 --> 09:27.780
and again he denied it, with an oath.

09:28.540 --> 09:30.300
I do not know the man.

09:31.000 --> 09:34.100
After a little while the bystanders came up and said to Peter,

09:34.860 --> 09:36.460
Certainly you too are one of them,

09:36.460 --> 09:38.340
for your accent betrays you.

09:39.020 --> 09:41.620
Then he began to invoke a curse on himself,

09:41.880 --> 09:42.840
and to swear,

09:43.620 --> 09:46.300
I do not know the man.

09:46.980 --> 09:48.700
And immediately the rooster crowed,

09:49.100 --> 09:51.760
and Peter remembered the saying of Jesus,

09:52.620 --> 09:54.020
Before the rooster crows,

09:54.620 --> 09:56.700
you will deny me three times.

09:56.700 --> 10:00.640
And he went out and wept bitterly.

